## Container images

Official SurvNG container images (for example `ghcr.io/instigatorx/survng`)
include:

- SurvNG application source and built frontend assets (MIT)
- go2rtc binary (MIT)
- FFmpeg from the Ubuntu package ecosystem (typically GPL/LGPL components;
  corresponding source for the packaged FFmpeg build is available through the
  distribution / PPA used in the `Dockerfile`)
- Python and Node dependencies listed in `requirements.txt` and
  `frontend/package-lock.json`
- Optional Intel GPU userspace packages in the `runtime-intel` image target
  (vendor redistribution terms apply)

